WEBVTT

00:21.313 --> 00:22.743
(Ryeo Un)

00:24.073 --> 00:25.983
(Choi Hyun Wook)

00:27.983 --> 00:29.682
(Seol In Ah)

00:34.623 --> 00:36.492
(Shin Eun Soo)

00:44.263 --> 00:48.101
(Twinkling Watermelon)

00:48.102 --> 00:49.271
(Production sponsors)

00:49.272 --> 00:51.201
(Ministry of Culture, Sports and Tourism, KOCCA)

00:51.202 --> 00:52.202
(All people, organizations, locations, and incidents...)

00:52.203 --> 00:53.241
(in this drama are fictitious.)

00:53.242 --> 00:54.242
(Staff ensured child actors' safety in the filming of this drama.)

00:54.243 --> 00:55.841
What does this mean?

00:55.842 --> 00:58.641
"The King's royal advisors who bring chaos to the nation."

00:58.642 --> 00:59.782
And these two characters here mean...

00:59.882 --> 01:02.152
"Jerks who would stab their own parents."

01:02.153 --> 01:04.753
You get the idea, right?

01:05.782 --> 01:06.851
Hi.

01:06.852 --> 01:09.022
I wonder if you'd know who I am.

01:10.022 --> 01:13.123
I'm not sure if you'll actually end up getting this letter,

01:13.592 --> 01:15.193
but I'm going to keep writing it anyway.

01:18.003 --> 01:19.461
Where should I even begin?

01:19.462 --> 01:20.803
Even after saying they'd never do it again,

01:21.232 --> 01:23.803
they'd leave their stuff at some pool hall and...

01:34.783 --> 01:37.283
The world where I live in is devoid of sound.

01:38.753 --> 01:40.582
So when I close my eyes like this,

01:40.583 --> 01:41.822
the whole world disappears.

01:43.352 --> 01:47.223
But in its place, a vivid old memory is brought up.

01:49.063 --> 01:50.393
A memory of someone...

01:50.732 --> 01:53.132
who used to call my name with her hand instead of her voice.

01:54.303 --> 01:56.902
Chung Ah.

02:02.673 --> 02:03.712
A clear...

02:08.083 --> 02:09.083
sound.

02:31.542 --> 02:32.602
Mom.

02:42.552 --> 02:43.612
I like you.

02:49.693 --> 02:50.822
I love you.

02:51.663 --> 02:53.623
Back then, I had a name,

02:53.862 --> 02:55.163
and I could smile.

02:56.193 --> 02:57.262
But...

03:03.503 --> 03:06.743
Chung Ah...

03:13.042 --> 03:15.783
(Mom, I like you.)

03:16.153 --> 03:18.622
(Mom, I love you.)

03:18.623 --> 03:20.683
Chung Ah!

04:10.873 --> 04:12.273
You must be Chung Ah.

04:15.012 --> 04:18.882
I'm your live-in tutor who will teach you starting today.

04:20.783 --> 04:22.412
That darned witch.

04:22.413 --> 04:24.182
She came to ruin my life.

04:24.183 --> 04:25.223
Say "Pa."

04:27.683 --> 04:28.723
Pa!

04:55.883 --> 04:56.883
Pa!

05:49.033 --> 05:51.442
At the time, all that I had left was my burning anger,

05:58.643 --> 06:02.413
because I had no other way of expressing myself and my feelings.

06:15.533 --> 06:17.362
- Try this.
- Is it good?

06:20.203 --> 06:22.272
Yes, it's good.

06:22.273 --> 06:24.642
- Yes.
- Oh, my. How have you been?

06:24.643 --> 06:26.073
- Hello!
- Hello.

06:26.643 --> 06:29.573
Move! Out of my way!

06:43.052 --> 06:45.292
- What's with him?
- Oh, no.

06:47.622 --> 06:49.932
- Hey, you!
- Gosh, I'm sorry!

06:57.273 --> 06:59.073
What's your deal? Hey!

06:59.903 --> 07:01.442
- How dare you!
- Gosh.

07:02.573 --> 07:03.872
Stop right there!

07:05.643 --> 07:08.311
On the day I first saw you,

07:08.312 --> 07:10.252
I got to laugh heartily for the first time in a long while.

07:34.343 --> 07:36.242
The second time I saw you,

07:36.713 --> 07:40.013
I felt the sound of my heartbeat for the first time ever.

07:40.112 --> 07:42.912
This is on the house.

07:42.913 --> 07:44.952
- My gosh. Thank you.
- Thank you.

07:44.953 --> 07:46.152
- Three vanillas, right?
- Even your heart is handsome.

07:46.153 --> 07:48.621
From the third time onward, I went to see you.

07:48.622 --> 07:50.552
- For real?
- Even your heart is handsome.

07:50.953 --> 07:52.291
Thank you, my heart is beautiful as well.

07:52.292 --> 07:53.893
Although you probably had no idea.

07:54.463 --> 07:56.093
Have a nice day!

08:13.383 --> 08:14.482
Actually,

08:16.013 --> 08:17.013
I'm in a band too.

08:17.014 --> 08:19.082
- What's this?
- What's he doing?

08:19.083 --> 08:20.223
- What's going on?
- My goodness.

08:20.482 --> 08:21.492
Se Gyeong.

08:22.093 --> 08:24.422
Do you want to come to our concert later?

08:24.763 --> 08:28.092
If I hadn't let Se Gyeong borrow that T-shirt...

08:28.093 --> 08:29.763
My school is having a festival a month later.

08:30.062 --> 08:32.002
I will prepare a performance, just for you.

08:32.203 --> 08:33.203
Please come to watch me.

08:33.204 --> 08:36.333
Then would I have been the one standing before you?

08:39.203 --> 08:40.643
I closed my eyes again...

08:41.302 --> 08:43.242
because I wanted the world to disappear.

09:13.403 --> 09:14.472
But...

09:17.243 --> 09:18.542
Interestingly enough,

09:18.613 --> 09:21.552
you always showed up whenever I was locked up.

09:25.753 --> 09:27.283
Sorry I bit your hand.

09:30.853 --> 09:32.322
And I'm sorry for being so feisty.

09:38.033 --> 09:39.633
If you need my help, let me know.

09:40.462 --> 09:42.702
Well, I'll be off then.

09:57.253 --> 09:58.882
(Ignite your passion to enjoy your youth to the fullest!)

09:58.883 --> 10:00.552
(Contact us to join the band, First Love Memory Manipulators.)

10:01.353 --> 10:03.253
I didn't react like that because I disliked you.

10:03.952 --> 10:05.062
The truth is...

10:11.633 --> 10:13.503
I wanted to thank you.

10:18.942 --> 10:23.243
I wanted to thank you for helping me and finding me.

10:23.743 --> 10:25.383
That's why I went to see you.

10:25.812 --> 10:28.082
To show you how I really felt.

10:28.253 --> 10:29.253
But...

10:31.283 --> 10:34.123
(Bestin Rabbit Thirty Seven Ice Cream)

10:39.422 --> 10:40.493
Hey, Se Gyeong.

10:40.562 --> 10:43.192
Hi. It's been a while, Yi Chan.

10:46.163 --> 10:47.202
But...

10:49.003 --> 10:50.332
it looks like...

10:51.273 --> 10:52.503
I was late once again.

11:10.192 --> 11:12.393
(Bestin Rabbit Thirty Seven Ice Cream)

11:12.422 --> 11:15.562
Se Gyeong, wait here. I'll be right back, okay?

11:23.233 --> 11:24.332
What's your deal?

11:24.802 --> 11:28.172
Oh, I don't understand what you're asking with such a vague question.

11:31.582 --> 11:32.883
You said you came back to die...

11:34.082 --> 11:36.153
and that you were still debating whether or not to end your life.

11:36.552 --> 11:38.921
You menacingly threatened me not to tell anyone that I saw you...

11:38.922 --> 11:41.123
unless I wanted to die, and then you disappeared.

11:41.483 --> 11:44.052
So why did you voluntarily show up here?

11:44.222 --> 11:45.922
My goodness.

11:46.192 --> 11:48.062
So it was actually such a deep question?

11:48.163 --> 11:50.992
No wonder why. My reading comprehension isn't bad.

11:50.993 --> 11:52.562
Stop changing the subject, and answer my question!

11:56.702 --> 11:57.832
I'm here because of you.

11:59.103 --> 12:00.142
What?

12:00.143 --> 12:02.513
Don't act like you didn't hear me. You heard what I said.

12:03.113 --> 12:04.472
I said it was because of you.

12:15.023 --> 12:16.853
Wait. Hey!

12:18.562 --> 12:19.592
Wait.

12:19.863 --> 12:21.023
Right, she can't hear.

12:32.373 --> 12:33.403
That wasn't me.

12:33.842 --> 12:34.903
I just...

12:38.042 --> 12:39.143
Wait.

13:07.472 --> 13:08.743
Because of me?

13:09.342 --> 13:10.413
What does that mean?

13:10.513 --> 13:12.842
Oh, it's not raining anymore.

13:13.613 --> 13:15.782
Answer me! I asked you what you meant by it!

13:15.783 --> 13:18.283
That startled me. Why are you yelling?

13:18.422 --> 13:21.483
You said I wasn't supposed to come back.

13:21.552 --> 13:24.451
I was curious what would happen if I didn't listen to you.

13:24.452 --> 13:25.493
Is that a good enough answer?

13:26.393 --> 13:27.993
Is Yi Chan a complete joke to you?

13:29.633 --> 13:31.702
Now you're just provoking me.

13:32.163 --> 13:33.662
Did I ever say I thought he was a joke?

13:33.663 --> 13:34.902
I'm just curious.

13:34.903 --> 13:37.733
You're toying with his feelings just for the sake of your curiosity.

13:38.503 --> 13:40.202
You still want to play around even though you wanted to die?

13:40.672 --> 13:41.873
Why? Am I not allowed to play?

13:42.672 --> 13:44.211
- What?
- Or are you telling me...

13:44.212 --> 13:45.912
to hurry up and decide whether or not to die?

13:45.913 --> 13:47.913
- That's not what I meant.
- If not that,

13:48.283 --> 13:50.952
are you saying I should just keep my mouth shut and die?

13:53.023 --> 13:56.422
Don't worry, I will disappear when the time comes.

13:58.462 --> 13:59.493
You...

14:00.222 --> 14:01.792
Are you really the Choi Se Gyeong I know?

14:02.033 --> 14:04.993
Se Gyeong! Choi Se Gyeong!

14:06.003 --> 14:07.903
I am Choi Se Gyeong, according to him.

14:11.033 --> 14:13.071
Sorry for keeping you waiting.

14:13.072 --> 14:14.242
Don't worry about it.

14:14.243 --> 14:16.143
It's on me for showing up without notice.

14:16.913 --> 14:20.383
Yi Chan, can we talk for a moment?

14:21.113 --> 14:24.783
Then give me a second. Let me go in and tell my manager.

14:27.082 --> 14:28.082
Sir!

14:29.552 --> 14:30.623
Aren't you leaving?

14:31.592 --> 14:34.222
Don't tell me you're tagging along just to third wheel like a loser.

14:45.842 --> 14:48.542
I heard you went to study abroad. So how are you...

14:54.582 --> 14:56.753
Why are you staring at me like that?

14:56.983 --> 14:59.283
So this is what you looked like, Yi Chan.

14:59.523 --> 15:00.523
What?

15:00.682 --> 15:02.493
You're much more handsome than I thought.

15:05.393 --> 15:06.921
Did you come back to make fun of me?

15:06.922 --> 15:08.493
No, of course not.

15:08.763 --> 15:10.033
Do you know how much I paid for my flight?

15:12.633 --> 15:14.103
I'm back because something came up.

15:14.263 --> 15:15.332
What happened?

15:15.873 --> 15:17.572
No one else seems to know that you're back.

15:17.702 --> 15:20.072
Of course, no one knows. I arrived yesterday.

15:20.603 --> 15:23.342
At the moment, you're the only one who knows that I'm back.

15:26.983 --> 15:28.983
Well, are you back for good?

15:30.853 --> 15:32.952
I'm not sure. I've still yet to decide on that.

15:34.383 --> 15:36.092
Then why did you come to see me?

15:36.592 --> 15:38.052
You left without a word.

15:40.292 --> 15:41.523
I came to apologize.

15:43.692 --> 15:46.202
I've been rude to you, and I feel bad about it.

15:47.233 --> 15:49.301
Sorry, I flat out belittled you...

15:49.302 --> 15:52.103
when I barely knew you. I want to apologize for that.

15:52.972 --> 15:54.042
And...

15:55.072 --> 15:57.442
I want to get to know you better.

15:57.672 --> 16:00.542
Of course, our bet's still on.

16:06.523 --> 16:08.353
Gosh, why isn't he back yet?

16:13.993 --> 16:15.692
What did she say? Why is she back?

16:16.292 --> 16:18.462
Why on earth did she come to see you?

16:18.832 --> 16:19.832
Hey.

16:21.562 --> 16:22.733
Have you ever been in a relationship?

16:23.233 --> 16:24.633
- A relationship?
- Yes.

16:25.373 --> 16:27.072
Well...

16:28.202 --> 16:29.273
Of course, I...

16:30.913 --> 16:33.042
Forget it. I already know what your answer will be.

16:33.913 --> 16:35.582
Your eyes were quivering just now.

16:39.653 --> 16:40.983
You poor sap.

16:41.552 --> 16:43.123
You're a fool who doesn't even know what love is.

16:44.493 --> 16:46.763
Could someone like you, who has never dated,

16:47.562 --> 16:50.562
understand the delicate conversation I had with Se Gyeong?

16:51.133 --> 16:52.331
What Se Gyeong told me was...

16:52.332 --> 16:54.932
Forget it. I'm not curious at all.

16:55.432 --> 16:56.672
Don't say another word.

16:57.133 --> 16:59.441
Hey, kiddo. Ask me again politely.

16:59.442 --> 17:01.242
You never know, I might tell you.

17:01.243 --> 17:03.773
Come on, I know you want to hear all about it.

17:14.783 --> 17:15.993
I'm not curious.

17:16.552 --> 17:17.722
I am not curious at all.

17:19.522 --> 17:22.262
- Oh, my!
- I'm telling you!

17:23.333 --> 17:25.192
- Ha Yi Chan!
- Ha Yi Chan!

17:25.663 --> 17:27.931
Se Gyeong, who cut her hair short,

17:27.932 --> 17:30.932
was standing right before my eyes.

17:31.373 --> 17:33.971
When I saw her, my heart skipped a beat.

17:33.972 --> 17:36.073
- Come on.
- Seriously, for real.

17:36.813 --> 17:39.242
What can I do besides fall for her again?

17:39.343 --> 17:42.083
Hey, who did you say she looked like?

17:42.413 --> 17:44.583
- Lee Young Ae?
- In the past, yes.

17:44.982 --> 17:46.153
Now, she looks like Ko So Young.

17:46.752 --> 17:50.293
If she used to charge me little by little like an electrolyte drink,

17:50.722 --> 17:52.363
now she's like... How should I put this?

17:53.422 --> 17:56.393
She's like a fizzy, carbonated drink that's intoxicatingly refreshing.

17:57.363 --> 17:59.603
That's quite an analogy!

18:01.032 --> 18:02.472
Guys, lean in closer.

18:03.002 --> 18:05.902
What can I do to make Se Gyeong totally mine?

18:05.903 --> 18:08.672
Hey, she's already all yours.

18:08.942 --> 18:10.813
- Really?
- Listen up.

18:12.083 --> 18:13.813
Women's hairs...

18:14.543 --> 18:15.883
have blood vessels running through them.

18:16.413 --> 18:17.752
Blood flows through them.

18:18.383 --> 18:20.682
You said she cut her hair short.

18:20.883 --> 18:22.793
That's like cutting her own veins.

18:23.323 --> 18:25.792
She's crying tears of blood!

18:25.793 --> 18:27.662
Why is that?

18:27.663 --> 18:29.662
What do you think? It's because of you!

18:29.663 --> 18:30.793
My gosh.

18:31.333 --> 18:33.802
Oh, my! Because of me?

18:33.803 --> 18:36.001
- Hey, you said she came to see you.
- Yes.

18:36.002 --> 18:38.772
And she apologized for being rude to you.

18:39.343 --> 18:41.402
She even said, "I want to get to know you better,"

18:41.403 --> 18:43.372
"and our bet's still on."

18:43.373 --> 18:44.471
What do you think all this means?

18:44.472 --> 18:46.712
Well, what does it mean?

18:47.782 --> 18:49.712
After she left, she realized how much she cared for you...

18:50.782 --> 18:52.582
and regretted letting you go!

18:52.583 --> 18:54.752
All the while, she was crying tears of blood.

18:54.883 --> 18:57.022
On top of that, she suddenly thinks you're handsome.

18:57.252 --> 19:00.322
- She's head over heels for you!
- That's right, it's game over.

19:00.323 --> 19:01.462
Game over!

19:03.663 --> 19:04.732
Guys, what should I do?

19:05.502 --> 19:07.432
Even I can't handle my own charms.

19:09.833 --> 19:11.332
- Goodness.
- Hey!

19:11.333 --> 19:12.941
- Se Gyeong!
- Ha Yi Chan!

19:12.942 --> 19:14.543
- Ha Yi Chan!
- Se Gyeong!

19:21.913 --> 19:25.583
It's like lyrics out of a trot song. Is that really what she's thinking?

19:36.133 --> 19:37.592
I mean, that Choi Se Gyeong?

19:37.593 --> 19:40.802
Open it. He left it behind for you.

19:40.803 --> 19:42.272
That's how I remember her.

19:43.672 --> 19:45.442
Are they really the same person?

19:46.202 --> 19:47.772
What is she really thinking?

19:48.043 --> 19:49.212
I came back to die.

19:49.913 --> 19:50.972
To die.

19:51.712 --> 19:52.813
To put an end to all of it.

19:53.643 --> 19:54.782
Don't worry.

19:55.012 --> 19:57.053
I will disappear when the time comes.

19:58.053 --> 19:59.053
No way.

20:00.482 --> 20:02.323
She can't actually be planning to take her own life, right?

20:12.903 --> 20:13.903
Hey!

20:14.732 --> 20:15.903
What are you doing here?

20:18.103 --> 20:19.972
How did you get my address?

20:22.272 --> 20:24.373
Yi Chan and I came here to see you once.

20:24.972 --> 20:26.083
Don't you remember?

20:28.482 --> 20:30.012
You did?

20:31.383 --> 20:32.922
You must care even less about Yi Chan...

20:33.482 --> 20:35.452
than the dirt under your toenails.

20:35.853 --> 20:38.252
Whatever. Why are you here?

20:41.593 --> 20:43.961
Forget it. It doesn't look like you'll starve to death for a while.

20:43.962 --> 20:45.063
What's this?

20:45.702 --> 20:48.133
Did you come all the way here because you were worried about me?

20:49.172 --> 20:51.833
I didn't know you were such an angel.

21:00.383 --> 21:01.442
Hey, you.

21:01.643 --> 21:02.852
If you make a hobby of threatening others,

21:02.853 --> 21:04.512
you'll end up becoming a swindler.

21:05.452 --> 21:07.553
You sure have a knack for it, so you should be careful.

21:09.053 --> 21:10.992
It looks like you have quite the talent for it too.

21:11.222 --> 21:12.262
Really?

21:15.593 --> 21:16.893
Then shall I flaunt my skills a little?

21:18.633 --> 21:20.803
You'd better not show up in front of Yi Chan again.

21:22.002 --> 21:23.032
This is your final warning.

21:31.242 --> 21:32.242
That little...

21:55.202 --> 21:57.333
(Baekwang High School)

21:59.843 --> 22:01.741
Hey, where are you going?

22:01.742 --> 22:03.441
Sorry, let me borrow this for a bit!

22:03.442 --> 22:04.442
Has he lost his mind?

22:04.443 --> 22:06.413
Hey, that's my skateboard!

22:13.123 --> 22:14.982
Move! Make way!

22:34.403 --> 22:39.012
(First Love Memory Manipulators)

22:41.782 --> 22:42.952
(First Love Memory Manipulators)

23:07.843 --> 23:09.012
Welcome, our front man!

23:09.742 --> 23:10.873
We were waiting for you.

23:11.573 --> 23:13.642
This is our first practice session. Are you ready to have some fun?

23:13.643 --> 23:15.083
Are you ready to set the stage on fire?

23:15.212 --> 23:17.052
Everybody, make some noise!

23:17.053 --> 23:19.922
- We're ready!
- We're ready!

23:21.553 --> 23:23.022
Come on, brothers!

23:30.932 --> 23:32.063
You must be out of your mind.

23:32.303 --> 23:33.531
How could you be late to our first practice session?

23:33.532 --> 23:34.931
Don't tell me you skateboarded here.

23:34.932 --> 23:37.302
If you're late again, I'll knock all your front teeth out.

23:37.303 --> 23:38.731
What if you got hurt skateboarding?

23:38.732 --> 23:39.941
Being late is better than getting hurt!

23:39.942 --> 23:41.441
I clearly warned you...

23:41.442 --> 23:42.711
to pour your heart and soul into this...

23:42.712 --> 23:44.112
if you want to keep the front man title.

23:44.113 --> 23:46.842
I told you to be careful at all times until the end of the year.

23:46.843 --> 23:49.052
Could you two at least arrive at an agreement...

23:49.053 --> 23:50.451
before lashing out at me?

23:50.452 --> 23:52.823
All right, guys. There's no time for chitchat.

23:52.952 --> 23:55.082
This is our set list, so check through it.

23:55.083 --> 23:56.921
There are four songs in total, including the encore performance.

23:56.922 --> 23:59.063
We all voted together for this. So there are no objections, right?

23:59.992 --> 24:01.592
Great, the set list has been finalized.

24:01.593 --> 24:03.932
We've hired a designer to design our official T-shirt.

24:04.262 --> 24:05.563
All right, then.

24:05.833 --> 24:08.333
Shall we begin our first practice session?

24:09.232 --> 24:11.073
- Front man.
- Why, manager?

24:17.972 --> 24:19.712
Why are you standing there? Aren't you going to practice?

24:43.472 --> 24:47.843
All right, let us now begin First Love Memory Manipulators'...

24:49.143 --> 24:50.343
first practice session.

24:53.242 --> 24:58.153
One, two, one, two, three, four.

25:15.603 --> 25:19.602
Who are you looking at?

25:19.603 --> 25:24.241
I'm standing right before your eyes

25:24.242 --> 25:28.211
Don't make me wait too long

25:28.212 --> 25:32.313
- Don't think that I'd be smiling - Eun Gyeol, add a double!

25:32.583 --> 25:36.422
- I don't expect a lot from you - I don't expect a lot from you

25:36.823 --> 25:41.191
- I just need a loving gaze - I just need a loving gaze

25:41.192 --> 25:45.531
- I want to tell you how I feel - I want to tell you how I feel

25:45.532 --> 25:52.702
- But your eyes say something else - But your eyes say something else

25:54.672 --> 25:58.613
- I thought we knew each other well - I thought we knew each other well

25:59.012 --> 26:03.113
- That's why I thought it was love - That's why I thought it was love

26:03.353 --> 26:07.252
- Don't go too far - Don't go too far

26:07.623 --> 26:12.792
- Someday, you will tell me - Someday, you will tell me

26:12.793 --> 26:16.462
- That you love me - That you love me

26:21.262 --> 26:22.702
We did pretty well today, don't you think?

26:22.873 --> 26:23.873
Yes.

26:23.874 --> 26:25.672
It wasn't bad, considering it was our first practice session.

26:26.502 --> 26:29.312
For the other songs, we just need to practice hard.

26:29.313 --> 26:30.972
The final song is the problem.

26:31.573 --> 26:32.643
The final song? What about it?

26:33.212 --> 26:35.343
It's not an easy song to master in such a short period of time.

26:36.012 --> 26:37.052
It's all someone's fault.

26:37.053 --> 26:39.352
Hey, if I work myself to the bone...

26:39.353 --> 26:40.482
Then we'll be meeting at your funeral.

26:40.883 --> 26:42.792
We really can't pull it off.

26:42.793 --> 26:44.653
- We should change it soon...
- No!

26:45.752 --> 26:47.663
Se Gyeong chose the song.

26:47.823 --> 26:49.062
We absolutely can't change it.

26:49.063 --> 26:50.431
You're an idiot.

26:50.432 --> 26:52.663
She wants to humiliate you, but you have no idea.

26:53.032 --> 26:54.133
What do you mean?

26:54.262 --> 26:56.201
Why do you think she chose that song?

26:56.202 --> 26:58.002
She likes Kurt Cobain. That's why!

26:58.133 --> 26:59.941
She wants to hear me singing the song!

26:59.942 --> 27:01.272
You're being ridiculous.

27:01.643 --> 27:03.412
She picked such a difficult song on purpose...

27:03.413 --> 27:04.671
to mess with you.

27:04.672 --> 27:05.741
To make you give up.

27:05.742 --> 27:08.312
Or to humiliate you on stage if you refuse to give up!

27:08.313 --> 27:09.781
Se Gyeong would never do that.

27:09.782 --> 27:11.312
Hey, calm down.

27:11.313 --> 27:13.582
Honestly, you're so delusional.

27:13.583 --> 27:15.623
Hey, you're the only one who doesn't know that.

27:15.752 --> 27:18.421
Everyone else in this whole area knows the truth.

27:18.422 --> 27:19.722
That's enough, okay?

27:19.962 --> 27:21.822
Our front man doesn't want to change the song.

27:21.823 --> 27:23.432
He says he will do his best.

27:23.492 --> 27:25.232
Can't you just trust him and let him do it?

27:25.532 --> 27:27.231
- Goodness.
- Okay, fine.

27:27.232 --> 27:28.603
We'll go for it even if we can't pull it off!

27:29.202 --> 27:30.772
Hey, what's going on over there?

27:30.873 --> 27:32.133
What's with all the fuss?

27:32.643 --> 27:34.672
- Take off the helmet.
- Take it off.

27:37.712 --> 27:40.412
- Hey, who is she?
- Take off your helmet.

27:40.413 --> 27:42.211
- My gosh.
- Are you here to see someone?

27:42.212 --> 27:44.211
- Take off your helmet.
- Take it off.

27:44.212 --> 27:45.412
- Show us your face.
- Show us.

27:45.413 --> 27:47.653
- No way. That can't be her.
- Who is she?

27:48.353 --> 27:50.721
- Take off your helmet.
- Take it off.

27:50.722 --> 27:53.062
- Are you here to meet someone?
- Take off your helmet.

27:53.063 --> 27:54.392
No way.

27:54.393 --> 27:55.962
I sternly warned her.

27:56.133 --> 27:57.793
- Take off your helmet.
- Let us see your face.

27:58.932 --> 28:01.962
- My gosh.
- It's Choi Se Gyeong!

28:04.232 --> 28:05.432
The warning didn't work at all.

28:05.633 --> 28:07.043
My gosh. Why is she here?

28:07.803 --> 28:10.711
- Oh, my.
- Look, it's Choi Se Gyeong!

28:10.712 --> 28:12.313
Yi Chan, hi!

28:20.752 --> 28:22.951
Se Gyeong, what brings you to this humble place?

28:22.952 --> 28:24.622
I went to the ice cream shop and was told...

28:24.623 --> 28:25.892
that you had a practice session today.

28:25.893 --> 28:27.663
So I'm here to show you my support.

28:28.593 --> 28:29.793
Guess what I have.

28:30.432 --> 28:31.992
Ta-da! How about we go to the amusement park?

28:35.432 --> 28:37.431
Hey, you really didn't have to do this.

28:37.432 --> 28:38.671
I want to tag along too.

28:38.672 --> 28:40.972
I bought tickets for you guys too. Do you want to join us?

28:41.002 --> 28:42.471
- Yes.
- Yes.

28:42.472 --> 28:43.512
No, I'm good.

28:43.813 --> 28:46.282
Okay. I assumed you'd say that, so I didn't buy your ticket.

28:46.313 --> 28:47.313
Yes, go home.

28:47.314 --> 28:48.712
You've been looking exhausted all day.

28:49.553 --> 28:51.353
Fine, I'm going home.

28:53.123 --> 28:54.721
I'm a pro when it comes to the pirate ship ride.

28:54.722 --> 28:56.952
I can ride it standing up and can even do a forward roll.

28:57.053 --> 28:58.852
Shall I show you a backflip too?

28:58.853 --> 29:00.562
- Really? Yes, show me later.
- Show her what?

29:00.563 --> 29:02.662
I can lift the front wheel while riding the scooter.

29:02.663 --> 29:04.092
- Do you want to see it?
- Lift what?

29:04.093 --> 29:06.163
- Let's go.
- No!

29:11.502 --> 29:13.442
My gosh. This is really fun.

29:22.182 --> 29:23.413
Have you lost your mind?

29:29.222 --> 29:30.852
- I'm coming at you!
- Bring it on!

29:30.853 --> 29:33.123
- Okay!
- Let's go!

29:35.563 --> 29:37.231
Hey, what was that? What are you doing?

29:37.232 --> 29:40.032
Move! You're blocking my way.

29:48.242 --> 29:49.343
Se Gyeong, are you ready?

29:49.712 --> 29:51.672
My gosh! You scared me.

29:51.843 --> 29:53.112
- Sit back down.
- Let go.

29:53.113 --> 29:54.711
Se Gyeong, help me!

29:54.712 --> 29:56.882
- Hey!
- Hey, stop.

29:56.883 --> 29:58.313
- Yi Chan!
- Stay seated, will you?

29:59.583 --> 30:00.981
- That little...
- Let's go.

30:00.982 --> 30:02.792
- Let's go.
- Hurry.

30:02.793 --> 30:04.623
- We're ready!
- Let's go!

30:23.143 --> 30:24.242
Watch.

30:26.043 --> 30:28.382
- My gosh!
- Oh, my!

30:28.383 --> 30:29.413
Thank you.

30:30.083 --> 30:31.313
Look at this balloon!

30:31.883 --> 30:33.352
My gosh! Look at this.

30:33.353 --> 30:35.052
Thank you. Woof!

30:35.053 --> 30:36.721
One, two.

30:36.722 --> 30:37.823
Wait!

30:38.053 --> 30:39.823
- I want to stand next to Yi Chan.
- My gosh.

30:40.262 --> 30:41.323
Come here, Se Gyeong.

30:42.293 --> 30:44.893
- One, two, three.
- Gosh.

30:48.303 --> 30:50.002
Follow me!

30:50.472 --> 30:51.532
- I'm good.
- Oh, my.

30:53.043 --> 30:54.442
Se Gyeong, do you need anything else?

30:54.873 --> 30:55.941
Do you want something else to drink?

30:55.942 --> 30:56.971
More chicken skewers? Butter-roasted?

30:56.972 --> 30:58.942
No, I'm good. This is enough food for me.

30:59.143 --> 31:01.981
By the way, where did the napkin go? It was right here.

31:01.982 --> 31:03.153
I have to wipe this off.

31:03.712 --> 31:04.812
- You need a napkin?
- Yes.

31:04.813 --> 31:06.752
Se Gyeong, I'll go get you a new one. One moment.

31:07.482 --> 31:08.522
Give me 13 seconds.

31:08.922 --> 31:11.092
He's cute. Hey, you have exactly 13 seconds.

31:11.093 --> 31:14.222
Thirteen, twelve, eleven...

31:18.532 --> 31:20.102
- Let go.
- You let go.

31:20.103 --> 31:21.702
No, you let go.

31:22.563 --> 31:23.573
Fine, it's all yours.

31:31.043 --> 31:32.073
- Oh!
- Gosh.

31:32.782 --> 31:35.883
Goodness. I'm so sorry.

31:36.282 --> 31:38.212
Wait just 13 seconds. He'll bring you a napkin shortly.

31:38.982 --> 31:40.022
You little...

31:47.722 --> 31:49.163
It was intentional, for sure.

31:49.663 --> 31:51.133
There was plenty of ketchup in the bottle.

31:51.692 --> 31:53.432
She didn't have to squeeze it so hard.

31:54.232 --> 31:56.573
I should've known she was up to something when she gave up.

31:57.633 --> 31:58.803
Darn it.

32:04.373 --> 32:05.442
What's your deal?

32:06.813 --> 32:07.942
Well...

32:08.012 --> 32:11.153
I don't understand what you're asking with such a vague question.

32:12.212 --> 32:13.782
You're good at applying things to different situations.

32:14.222 --> 32:17.792
Well, why are you so overprotective of Yi Chan?

32:17.793 --> 32:20.622
Why would you ruin his friendship which is perfectly healthy?

32:20.623 --> 32:21.761
You seem very passionate about it.

32:21.762 --> 32:23.991
I don't want him to get into an unhealthy relationship with a girl.

32:23.992 --> 32:25.692
I'm trying to guide him to the right path.

32:26.303 --> 32:27.402
Who do you think you are?

32:27.403 --> 32:30.103
Me? I'm Yi Chan's tutor.

32:30.272 --> 32:32.803
I must make sure Yi Chan gets into college.

32:33.303 --> 32:35.872
I'll get rid of everything that could distract him from his studies.

32:35.873 --> 32:37.073
That includes you.

32:37.843 --> 32:39.613
Many people must've told you that you're too nosy.

32:40.313 --> 32:42.383
People mostly say that I'm responsible.

32:43.212 --> 32:44.752
Forget it. I'm off.

32:45.482 --> 32:47.522
I get that you've been through a lot.

32:49.222 --> 32:52.452
I understand you want to misbehave because you want to rebel.

32:53.492 --> 32:55.623
But stop toying with that naive guy's feelings.

32:56.363 --> 32:57.432
Please.

33:01.303 --> 33:02.403
Who said...

33:02.732 --> 33:04.333
I was toying with his feelings?

33:04.672 --> 33:06.602
You don't even like Yi Chan.

33:06.603 --> 33:08.343
Feelings constantly change.

33:09.712 --> 33:10.742
Forget it.

33:11.043 --> 33:12.643
You and Yi Chan can't be together anyway.

33:12.982 --> 33:14.413
He's meant to be with someone else.

33:14.643 --> 33:15.782
And who is that?

33:16.452 --> 33:17.512
Just someone.

33:18.452 --> 33:19.583
You don't need to know.

33:19.952 --> 33:23.553
I want your dad to become much happier than he is now.

33:23.793 --> 33:27.093
Someone who loves Yi Chan and cares for him more than anybody else.

33:27.492 --> 33:28.823
Even if I told you,

33:30.563 --> 33:31.863
you wouldn't believe me.

33:38.403 --> 33:39.472
It must be you.

33:40.672 --> 33:42.343
You have a crush on Yi Chan, don't you?

33:42.742 --> 33:45.042
What? What are you talking about?

33:45.043 --> 33:47.582
Come on. It's okay. I'm very open-minded.

33:47.583 --> 33:49.343
I have no bias against such things.

33:49.512 --> 33:51.853
- What are you talking about?
- Don't worry.

33:52.413 --> 33:53.882
I won't tell anyone.

33:53.883 --> 33:56.952
However, we must compete fair and square.

33:57.793 --> 33:58.853
Good luck!

34:00.262 --> 34:01.293
Hey.

34:01.323 --> 34:03.691
It's not what you think! Hey!

34:03.692 --> 34:06.632
- My gosh. That was why.
- It really isn't what you think.

34:06.633 --> 34:08.363
- Okay, I heard you.
- Se Gyeong.

34:09.303 --> 34:10.502
Where have you been?

34:11.603 --> 34:12.803
I looked everywhere for you.

34:14.143 --> 34:15.143
No!

34:15.903 --> 34:17.472
What is this?

34:23.452 --> 34:24.512
- Se Gyeong!
- Se Gyeong!

34:25.882 --> 34:27.483
Are you okay? Are you hurt?

34:29.523 --> 34:31.123
Get off me, will you?

34:31.623 --> 34:32.693
Gosh.

34:34.722 --> 34:37.063
Hey, let's talk.

34:37.492 --> 34:38.492
This is embarrassing.

34:45.873 --> 34:46.943
Darn it.

34:51.443 --> 34:52.643
Seriously, what's with you?

34:52.842 --> 34:54.281
You could've gotten hurt.

34:54.282 --> 34:55.841
Always look carefully when walking.

34:55.842 --> 34:58.282
What are you, my nanny? Superman?

34:58.413 --> 35:00.651
Do you suddenly feel a surge of strength...

35:00.652 --> 35:02.923
when something happens to people?

35:03.222 --> 35:05.023
You feel so powerful that you can't control yourself?

35:06.193 --> 35:07.221
Let's get going.

35:07.222 --> 35:08.261
It's almost time for your tutoring session.

35:08.262 --> 35:09.322
No!

35:09.932 --> 35:11.292
You should be helping me, if anything.

35:11.293 --> 35:14.902
Why must you ruin everything for me? Just why?

35:18.003 --> 35:19.602
Can't you just do as I say?

35:19.603 --> 35:21.943
- Do what?
- Can't you just listen to me...

35:22.643 --> 35:24.071
without asking me...

35:24.072 --> 35:26.143
why I'm being like this or why I'm doing this?

35:27.143 --> 35:28.282
Just for a year.

35:29.213 --> 35:31.112
Just for one year, not your whole life.

35:31.452 --> 35:33.853
Can't you even stay by my side just for one year?

35:41.393 --> 35:42.522
No, guys.

35:42.523 --> 35:43.693
So that was what it was about.

35:44.532 --> 35:45.793
I knew it.

35:46.632 --> 35:48.302
I didn't know.

35:48.432 --> 35:50.333
Let's respect their preference...

35:50.603 --> 35:52.071
and pretend that we didn't see that just now.

35:52.072 --> 35:54.702
No, it's not what you think!

35:55.202 --> 35:58.373
Se Gyeong. It's not like that.

35:58.512 --> 36:00.841
It's okay. I didn't see anything.

36:00.842 --> 36:02.643
I'm not okay that you're okay.

36:03.112 --> 36:06.052
Hey, you, we'll talk about this later.

36:06.782 --> 36:07.923
Se Gyeong.

36:13.693 --> 36:15.163
It's late.

36:15.693 --> 36:17.362
I want to take you home.

36:17.793 --> 36:19.492
It won't take long by scooter.

36:19.663 --> 36:21.532
I'd like to give you a ride,

36:22.603 --> 36:24.471
but I promised to play fair with someone,

36:24.472 --> 36:25.572
so I can't do that.

36:28.802 --> 36:29.842
All right.

36:29.943 --> 36:32.043
Make sure to page me when you get home then.

36:32.512 --> 36:33.583
I gave you my number earlier.

36:34.043 --> 36:35.043
Okay.

36:35.044 --> 36:36.583
I'll page you as soon as I get home.

36:37.483 --> 36:39.051
I had so much fun thanks to you.

36:39.052 --> 36:41.122
I'll see you guys later. Bye.

36:41.123 --> 36:42.322
- Bye.
- Bye.

36:47.893 --> 36:50.132
- Let's go.
- Let's go.

36:50.592 --> 36:52.193
Keep more than three meters apart.

36:53.632 --> 36:54.663
Let's go together.

37:05.673 --> 37:06.742
It's not what you think.

37:09.182 --> 37:10.213
What?

37:11.713 --> 37:13.722
Yi Chan and I aren't a thing.

37:14.322 --> 37:16.222
I don't like him. I mean...

37:17.123 --> 37:18.623
It's not that I don't like him.

37:19.293 --> 37:20.762
I do like him,

37:21.322 --> 37:25.193
but not in the way you think.

37:25.862 --> 37:28.361
Anyway, Yi Chan and I...

37:28.362 --> 37:31.273
can never be a thing.

37:31.833 --> 37:33.873
I see.

37:34.802 --> 37:35.802
Okay.

37:36.813 --> 37:38.242
I know that it looks strange.

37:39.012 --> 37:40.682
But the reason why I am being strange...

37:42.282 --> 37:43.612
isn't because of Yi Chan.

37:44.313 --> 37:45.382
It's not?

37:47.552 --> 37:48.782
Then what's the reason?

37:49.583 --> 37:50.652
Actually,

37:52.293 --> 37:54.362
I have a secret I can't say.

37:55.193 --> 37:56.962
A secret? What secret?

37:56.963 --> 37:59.532
I can't say it. Because it's a secret I can't say.

38:08.302 --> 38:09.402
Do you perhaps...

38:12.572 --> 38:14.242
Do you like me?

38:15.083 --> 38:16.812
- What?
- Think about it.

38:16.813 --> 38:18.451
Whenever I'm with Yi Chan,

38:18.452 --> 38:20.423
you interfere and interrupt us, keeping us in check.

38:20.652 --> 38:22.381
I'm sure it's out of jealousy.

38:22.382 --> 38:23.492
But you said it wasn't because of Yi Chan.

38:24.793 --> 38:26.092
It means you like me.

38:27.193 --> 38:28.792
I was trying to clear an issue,

38:28.793 --> 38:30.192
but now, I have another one.

38:30.193 --> 38:31.262
Bye.

38:34.963 --> 38:36.402
Be honest with me.

38:39.132 --> 38:40.503
Is it me?

38:40.773 --> 38:43.242
Or is it Yi Chan?

38:46.143 --> 38:47.182
Who is it?

39:01.393 --> 39:04.793
Don't be mistaken that everyone likes you.

39:05.432 --> 39:06.962
I'm not mistaken.

39:06.963 --> 39:08.233
Everyone likes me.

39:11.603 --> 39:12.932
I'm sorry, but you're not my type.

39:14.242 --> 39:15.242
Gosh.

39:16.402 --> 39:19.313
It's indeed fun to tease him.

39:26.213 --> 39:27.682
Let's get it together.

39:29.452 --> 39:31.693
Please get it together.

39:32.753 --> 39:34.893
- Please!
- Oh, my goodness gracious.

39:35.663 --> 39:38.362
Are you worried about Se Gyeong who went home by herself?

39:38.862 --> 39:40.332
Give me your pager.

39:40.333 --> 39:42.032
I'll keep it until the lesson is over.

39:44.003 --> 39:45.003
Oh, my.

39:46.532 --> 39:48.202
Here comes Se Gyeong.

39:48.702 --> 39:49.702
Se Gyeong.

39:54.742 --> 39:55.813
Se Gyeong.

39:57.583 --> 39:58.682
Is this the phone number of your house?

39:59.782 --> 40:00.952
I'll save it in my heart.

40:02.923 --> 40:03.991
No.

40:03.992 --> 40:06.123
It's all good as long as you got home safely.

40:07.563 --> 40:09.361
Hang up when I'm being nice.

40:09.362 --> 40:10.991
The lesson isn't over yet.

40:10.992 --> 40:11.992
What?

40:12.663 --> 40:14.602
You heard something? It's nothing.

40:14.603 --> 40:16.901
It was a fly buzzing.

40:16.902 --> 40:17.971
"A fly?"

40:17.972 --> 40:19.942
Give it to me.

40:19.943 --> 40:21.172
- Hey.
- Se Gyeong,

40:21.173 --> 40:22.673
I'll get back to you after I catch the fly.

40:30.213 --> 40:32.882
Se Gyeong, I caught it. You've been waiting for a long time.

40:33.322 --> 40:34.821
- Even my dad has never hit me.
- I'm sorry.

40:34.822 --> 40:36.893
Come here.

40:38.393 --> 40:39.963
The fly is harder to catch than I thought.

40:42.092 --> 40:44.092
Hey. Stop.

40:48.003 --> 40:49.932
Don't call me a fly. Give it to me.

40:53.342 --> 40:55.143
I caught it.

40:56.813 --> 40:59.612
You want to change the final song? What are you talking about?

41:00.143 --> 41:02.082
It's for your mission as well.

41:02.083 --> 41:03.142
Will you be okay?

41:03.143 --> 41:04.813
Of course, I will.

41:05.213 --> 41:06.483
Se Gyeong told me to change it.

41:07.123 --> 41:08.182
Why all of a sudden?

41:08.753 --> 41:11.923
Actually, I asked her on the phone yesterday.

41:12.552 --> 41:15.663
That if the mission song was chosen to screw me up.

41:17.293 --> 41:18.393
They will misunderstand.

41:18.793 --> 41:19.833
And then?

41:21.202 --> 41:22.333
Change it, then.

41:22.833 --> 41:25.072
A band doesn't always have to do songs in English, does it?

41:25.503 --> 41:27.772
Korean music might top Billboard charts,

41:27.773 --> 41:30.612
making a foray into a global market someday.

41:30.873 --> 41:32.673
You also need to get ahead of your time.

41:33.543 --> 41:36.512
Gosh, the scale got bigger.

41:36.643 --> 41:38.381
I approve it. I approve it 100 percent.

41:38.382 --> 41:40.983
I approve of it too. The song was too hard anyway.

41:41.853 --> 41:43.083
Then I approve as well.

41:44.322 --> 41:45.353
I object.

41:46.862 --> 41:48.523
What are you guys doing?

41:49.623 --> 41:51.261
We don't even have a month until the festival.

41:51.262 --> 41:53.603
No. Even if we have more than enough time,

41:54.663 --> 41:56.971
does it make sense that we're changing it because she said so?

41:56.972 --> 41:58.031
Why does it not make sense?

41:58.032 --> 41:59.571
The one who made a bet told me to change it.

41:59.572 --> 42:00.773
What if she changes her mind?

42:01.402 --> 42:02.772
Then will you change it again to please her?

42:02.773 --> 42:03.813
Of course, I will.

42:04.242 --> 42:07.083
Se Gyeong gave up studying abroad and returned to Korea because of me.

42:07.282 --> 42:09.313
I'll do anything she wants.

42:09.983 --> 42:12.011
I'll put my life on it to keep my promise to her.

42:12.012 --> 42:13.582
Is the promise you made to me nothing then?

42:13.583 --> 42:14.952
My goodness.

42:15.423 --> 42:17.592
What promise did I make to you?

42:19.722 --> 42:20.722
Darn it.

42:21.393 --> 42:22.393
I got it.

42:23.793 --> 42:24.932
Then I'll leave.

42:26.632 --> 42:27.663
That will do.

42:30.072 --> 42:31.672
- Hey.
- Hey.

42:31.673 --> 42:32.931
Look at him acting like he's the most important guy here...

42:32.932 --> 42:34.202
just because he can play the guitar.

42:34.773 --> 42:37.943
He must be the epitome of pettiness.

42:38.713 --> 42:40.543
What are you doing, you punk? Go after him right now.

42:41.413 --> 42:42.483
Hurry up.

42:44.012 --> 42:45.853
Stop right there when I'm being nice.

42:46.083 --> 42:47.983
Hey. For goodness' sake.

42:49.822 --> 42:52.022
You ruined the mood.

42:52.023 --> 42:54.122
Everyone likes the idea. Why are you making a fuss?

42:54.123 --> 42:55.623
Is the band a joke to you?

42:56.123 --> 42:57.663
Is it just bait to hook up with a girl?

42:58.432 --> 42:59.463
Someone...

43:00.733 --> 43:03.232
even messed up with their parents to become a member of a band.

43:03.233 --> 43:04.302
My goodness.

43:04.972 --> 43:06.201
Why do you have to bring up someone's parents...

43:06.202 --> 43:09.142
when I just want to change a song?

43:09.143 --> 43:10.672
Falling for those sugar-coated words,

43:10.673 --> 43:12.213
making a fool of yourself...

43:12.873 --> 43:14.742
You don't even remember the promise you made to me, do you?

43:15.043 --> 43:18.712
You don't care about anyone else except for Se Gyeong, right?

43:18.713 --> 43:20.753
Whatever. Just tell me.

43:21.023 --> 43:22.353
Are you staying in the band or not?

43:25.123 --> 43:26.123
Okay.

43:26.862 --> 43:27.862
I'll quit.

43:28.523 --> 43:29.722
I'm tired now.

43:31.932 --> 43:34.202
Whatever happens to you, it's not my business.

43:35.333 --> 43:36.362
I quit.

43:38.072 --> 43:39.773
Don't do something you're going to regret.

43:40.402 --> 43:42.572
If you leave like this, you can never come back.

43:43.043 --> 43:45.943
To the band and the guesthouse.

43:46.373 --> 43:48.443
Hey, I said you can never come back.

43:50.382 --> 43:51.413
Darn it!

43:52.612 --> 43:54.022
Water and oil don't mix.

43:54.023 --> 43:55.322
Right. Oh, my gosh.

43:56.023 --> 43:58.752
He's growing late. He hasn't even dated anyone.

43:58.753 --> 44:00.762
He's going through puberty just now.

44:01.222 --> 44:02.861
Why are you alone? What about Eun Gyeol?

44:02.862 --> 44:04.532
Forget it. Let's just practice.

44:05.032 --> 44:06.902
He'll come back once he cools off.

44:07.402 --> 44:09.602
That's what he will think, but no.

44:09.603 --> 44:10.632
I'm not going back ever again.

44:11.873 --> 44:13.702
(Used Musical Instruments)

44:14.103 --> 44:15.103
Hey, young man.

44:15.943 --> 44:18.873
You're the good son who wanted to get a guitar for your father, right?

44:19.443 --> 44:20.612
Hello.

44:20.813 --> 44:22.212
I found the perfect guitar.

44:22.213 --> 44:23.652
It's everything you were looking for.

44:24.213 --> 44:26.151
Come inside and check it out. If you like it, it's yours.

44:26.152 --> 44:27.882
I'll match the price you want.

44:28.052 --> 44:30.353
No. I don't need it anymore.

44:30.652 --> 44:31.692
Bye.

44:31.693 --> 44:34.023
(Used Musical Instruments)

44:38.362 --> 44:39.432
They fought.

44:40.092 --> 44:41.663
He and his father must have fought.

44:47.643 --> 44:50.612
(Woori Mart)

45:09.092 --> 45:10.563
Thank you.

45:10.793 --> 45:13.492
Please buy something tasty with this.

45:15.103 --> 45:17.402
I'm sorry to leave without saying goodbye, Grandma.

45:19.202 --> 45:20.342
But...

45:21.842 --> 45:23.273
you see,

45:25.012 --> 45:28.112
watching the immature version of Dad is too much for me to handle.

45:40.963 --> 45:42.123
I'm home.

45:48.902 --> 45:50.673
Why are you alone? What about your tutor?

45:52.132 --> 45:53.373
That punk hasn't come home yet?

45:53.742 --> 45:55.802
How rude!

45:56.342 --> 45:58.412
How dare you call your tutor like that?

45:58.413 --> 46:00.413
He's not some dog next door. He's your tutor.

46:00.742 --> 46:02.643
Grandma, you'll hurt my feelings if you keep scolding me like this.

46:02.813 --> 46:05.452
People might think that I'm just a servant,

46:05.483 --> 46:07.452
and he's your real grandson.

46:08.083 --> 46:10.292
Then you shouldn't have come home without him.

46:10.293 --> 46:12.551
He went to your school this afternoon to see you.

46:12.552 --> 46:13.623
Did you not see him?

46:13.822 --> 46:14.862
Oh, that.

46:15.362 --> 46:17.492
We did meet at my school.

46:17.733 --> 46:19.162
But he went to Chuncheon...

46:19.163 --> 46:20.862
because he had something to take care of.

46:21.262 --> 46:23.672
Do you need me to put the laundry in the Apple Room?

46:23.673 --> 46:25.531
Put it down gently. Don't mess it up.

46:25.532 --> 46:26.532
Okay.

46:26.533 --> 46:27.902
Right. Yi Chan.

46:28.003 --> 46:30.373
I found this while doing laundry. Is this yours?

46:32.342 --> 46:35.112
Oh, that. Someone dropped it on the street.

46:35.313 --> 46:37.713
I see. Then you should return it right away.

46:38.052 --> 46:40.722
It seemed perfectly fine, but I ended up washing that too.

46:40.923 --> 46:43.753
Forget it. I can't talk to her anyway. It's a hassle.

46:44.492 --> 46:46.193
Gosh. That punk.

46:47.693 --> 46:50.632
I was thinking about boiling chicken with some ginseng.

46:51.063 --> 46:52.862
I wonder if he will be back by tomorrow.

47:02.273 --> 47:04.742
He's definitely going through a rebellious phase. Seriously.

47:06.713 --> 47:08.443
So you took your backpack too?

47:09.213 --> 47:10.652
Are you that upset?

47:11.282 --> 47:12.612
Let's see how long you last.

47:12.682 --> 47:14.382
Only you will suffer if you leave.

47:17.853 --> 47:19.523
It's nice to have the room to myself.

47:30.233 --> 47:34.043
You don't care about anyone else except for Se Gyeong, right?

47:35.603 --> 47:36.773
He and his lectures. Darn it.

47:37.313 --> 47:38.673
You'd better not come back.

47:41.813 --> 47:43.083
This room is nice and big.

47:54.063 --> 47:55.892
Kid.

47:55.893 --> 47:57.293
Wake up.

47:57.463 --> 47:58.532
Kid.

48:02.003 --> 48:03.031
(Woori Mart)

48:03.032 --> 48:05.103
You can't fall asleep in front of my store.

48:08.702 --> 48:10.043
Did you run away from home?

48:10.943 --> 48:12.742
Should I call the police?

48:12.972 --> 48:14.043
No.

48:15.242 --> 48:16.782
I'm sorry.

48:49.483 --> 48:50.512
Hello.

48:50.713 --> 48:52.652
Good evening.

48:55.682 --> 48:58.792
So? Have you found out the reason you're here?

48:58.793 --> 48:59.822
No.

49:00.623 --> 49:03.193
Forget it. Everything's just a mess.

49:03.563 --> 49:06.062
My dad is out of his mind and fixated on his first love.

49:06.063 --> 49:07.802
I have no idea where my mom is.

49:07.963 --> 49:10.471
People got the wrong idea about me. I got into a huge fight with my dad.

49:10.472 --> 49:11.932
Nothing's going my way.

49:12.273 --> 49:14.143
Oh, no. You poor thing.

49:16.402 --> 49:18.572
Forget about the mission. I just want to go home.

49:19.012 --> 49:20.642
I don't want that immature version of Ha Yi Chan.

49:20.643 --> 49:22.112
I miss my real dad.

49:23.143 --> 49:24.213
I miss my mom...

49:24.782 --> 49:26.413
and Eun Ho too.

49:27.483 --> 49:31.793
So please send me back home. Please?

49:32.092 --> 49:33.491
That's too bad.

49:33.492 --> 49:36.563
The door of space and time won't be opening anytime soon.

49:37.762 --> 49:39.893
Then when will it open again?

49:40.163 --> 49:42.862
- You'll find out in due time.
- Are you serious right now?

49:43.032 --> 49:44.732
You made me travel back in time without my permission.

49:44.733 --> 49:46.873
How could you keep telling me such irresponsible things?

49:48.342 --> 49:49.673
If you leave now,

49:49.842 --> 49:54.213
2023 will be very different from what you're used to.

49:55.282 --> 49:56.882
Do you still want to go back?

49:57.382 --> 49:58.452
What...

49:59.913 --> 50:00.922
do you mean?

50:00.923 --> 50:03.322
Oh, no. You must not have known.

50:04.123 --> 50:06.522
The moment you arrived here,

50:06.523 --> 50:08.923
everything started to change.

50:13.563 --> 50:14.902
(Used Books, The Day)

50:16.603 --> 50:18.773
- I'm sorry.
- Excuse me, you...

50:25.612 --> 50:27.642
(The CNUE Monthly, April 1995 Issue)

50:27.643 --> 50:28.643
Yoon Dong Jin?

50:31.583 --> 50:32.611
It's you.

50:32.612 --> 50:34.023
Yes, I am.

50:35.652 --> 50:38.853
I'm Yoon Dong Jin.

50:39.793 --> 50:40.923
I don't think you are.

50:41.523 --> 50:42.793
What should I do to make you believe that?

50:42.923 --> 50:45.532
The moment you pretended to be someone,

50:45.762 --> 50:49.003
history started to change little by little.

50:49.532 --> 50:52.773
The same goes for the fate of the people you crossed paths.

50:53.132 --> 50:54.242
Their fate must have changed too.

50:54.443 --> 50:57.472
You said I wasn't supposed to come back.

50:57.612 --> 51:00.341
I was curious what would happen if I didn't listen to you.

51:00.342 --> 51:01.442
Is that a good enough answer?

51:01.443 --> 51:02.443
No way.

51:04.552 --> 51:06.983
My dad's first love suddenly came back.

51:08.322 --> 51:10.822
Their reunion wasn't supposed to happen, but it did.

51:12.193 --> 51:14.123
I caused all of these changes?

51:15.063 --> 51:16.092
I'm not sure.

51:16.222 --> 51:19.792
But changes can cause more changes.

51:19.793 --> 51:21.662
Stop acting like a know-it-all with your vague comments.

51:21.663 --> 51:23.563
Just give me a hint or something.

51:23.702 --> 51:25.272
Tell me how I can fix this...

51:25.273 --> 51:26.801
or how I can stop my dad's accident.

51:26.802 --> 51:28.442
Or tell me how I can find my mom.

51:28.443 --> 51:30.372
Just tell me what to do, please.

51:30.373 --> 51:33.213
Oh, no. I have already given you all of the hints.

51:33.543 --> 51:34.742
What hints?

51:34.882 --> 51:38.213
Why don't you go and check? Then we'll resume our talk.

51:41.722 --> 51:44.352
- Goodbye.
- Wait.

51:44.353 --> 51:46.092
Hello? Come on!

51:59.003 --> 52:00.773
He already gave me all of the hints?

52:19.592 --> 52:20.762
No way.

52:21.393 --> 52:22.523
Is this it?

52:24.092 --> 52:26.031
(Jinsung Phoenix Standard, Jinsung's first electric guitar)

52:26.032 --> 52:27.092
Wait.

52:27.563 --> 52:29.233
April 29.

52:30.233 --> 52:31.373
That's tomorrow.

52:32.873 --> 52:35.242
Does it mean I'll be able to get a clue there?

52:37.302 --> 52:40.312
It's the first electric guitar Jinsung is launching.

52:40.313 --> 52:42.212
So my father has high hopes for this product.

52:42.213 --> 52:45.151
As I'm here today on behalf of the chairman,

52:45.152 --> 52:47.552
we must have a successful event no matter what.

52:47.923 --> 52:49.423
Is everything going according to plan?

52:49.853 --> 52:51.492
Well,

52:51.923 --> 52:53.722
we have a problem.

52:54.592 --> 52:55.722
A problem?

52:55.893 --> 52:57.861
The weather forecast says there will be heavy rain...

52:57.862 --> 52:59.592
along with thunder and lightning this afternoon.

52:59.833 --> 53:00.861
We can proceed with...

53:00.862 --> 53:03.003
the press conference and the indoor event as planned.

53:03.132 --> 53:06.131
It may be prudent for us to postpone the outdoor event for now.

53:06.132 --> 53:07.472
What are you talking about?

53:08.302 --> 53:09.502
We're revealing our product for the first time today.

53:09.503 --> 53:11.172
We must be in the limelight.

53:11.173 --> 53:13.213
Don't you know if we postpone it, people will lose interest?

53:13.773 --> 53:15.982
That's true. But they issued an alert for heavy rain.

53:15.983 --> 53:17.482
Listen. I was told that...

53:17.483 --> 53:18.951
the majority of the participants are in their 20s.

53:18.952 --> 53:20.312
What's youth good for?

53:20.313 --> 53:22.222
They can handle some raindrops.

53:23.583 --> 53:25.693
Proceed as planned. Okay?

53:26.222 --> 53:27.862
Just give out rain ponchos to the audience.

53:28.293 --> 53:30.792
If there's an accident because we pushed forward with this,

53:30.793 --> 53:31.862
the chairman...

53:32.432 --> 53:33.492
Did you just...

53:35.362 --> 53:37.202
dismiss what I said?

53:38.833 --> 53:40.173
Don't you know who I am?

53:41.072 --> 53:42.673
I'm the heir of this company.

53:42.902 --> 53:44.642
My wish is the chairman's wish.

53:44.643 --> 53:47.643
Proceed with the event unless you want to get fired.

53:52.112 --> 53:54.322
(Celebratory Audition of Launching Jinsung Phoenix Standard)

53:55.023 --> 53:58.252
Let me test the microphone again. Testing the microphone.

53:58.253 --> 54:00.222
One, two. One.

54:02.693 --> 54:04.632
One, two.

54:06.163 --> 54:08.663
(Jinsung Phoenix Standard)

54:12.702 --> 54:13.873
That looks amazing.

54:16.103 --> 54:17.143
(Invitation)

54:21.282 --> 54:23.242
(We invite you to participate in a special audition by Jinsung.)

54:25.782 --> 54:27.452
The winning prize of the audition...

54:27.782 --> 54:29.423
is a brand-new guitar?

54:32.592 --> 54:35.591
- Are you number ten?
- What? No. It was just...

54:35.592 --> 54:37.123
The waiting room is this way. Come and follow me.

54:45.432 --> 54:48.003
- Come on.
- Gosh. Let me focus.

54:48.603 --> 54:50.241
She's been dozing off all day.

54:50.242 --> 54:51.373
It's like she's on medication or something.

54:52.112 --> 54:53.571
She got soaking wet from the rain a few days ago.

54:53.572 --> 54:55.182
She almost had pneumonia.

54:55.443 --> 54:58.212
Yoon Sang A got super annoyed, watching her act all pitiful.

54:58.213 --> 54:59.982
- Gosh. What a nuisance.
- Why would anyone pity her?

54:59.983 --> 55:01.582
Darn it. It's lopsided.

55:01.583 --> 55:02.922
Hey, it's not lopsided.

55:02.923 --> 55:04.952
- You look good. That's enough.
- It looks fine.

55:05.152 --> 55:06.821
Everyone. There's a special lecture on respecting life...

55:06.822 --> 55:08.892
instead of the end-of-the-day meeting.

55:08.893 --> 55:10.221
We all have to go to the auditorium.

55:10.222 --> 55:12.193
- Come on.
- Are you serious?

55:12.762 --> 55:14.762
- That's too much.
- Auditorium? Shouldn't we go home?

55:16.103 --> 55:17.801
Shouldn't we tell her?

55:17.802 --> 55:19.071
It's not like she can hear us.

55:19.072 --> 55:20.333
She has eyes. She can read the board.

55:20.943 --> 55:22.672
- Let's go.
- What special lecture?

55:22.673 --> 55:24.142
Do you want to skip the lecture and go for some snacks?

55:24.143 --> 55:25.812
- Are you in?
- Come on.

55:25.813 --> 55:27.012
- I should just take a nap instead.
- Gosh.

55:27.143 --> 55:29.012
If you're going to take a nap...

55:52.432 --> 55:53.532
Mom.

55:54.972 --> 55:56.103
I'm sick.

55:57.612 --> 56:01.443
(I like you.)

56:02.342 --> 56:03.342
Liar.

56:04.753 --> 56:05.913
You left me.

56:07.313 --> 56:09.123
You left me behind.

56:29.273 --> 56:30.542
Hello.

56:30.543 --> 56:32.971
- I keep...
- Have you been well?

56:32.972 --> 56:34.213
seeing things.

56:34.342 --> 56:37.652
Right. This is yours, right?

56:41.353 --> 56:42.583
I'm sorry about the other day.

56:43.923 --> 56:45.322
(Yoon Chung Ah)

56:46.523 --> 56:48.721
Dad, you're supposed to be in love with Yoon Chung Ah!

56:48.722 --> 56:50.592
Who is Yoon Chung Ah?

56:51.693 --> 56:54.402
What? You're the Yoon Chung Ah he was talking about?

56:57.132 --> 56:58.202
What's wrong with you?

56:58.702 --> 56:59.702
Are you okay?

57:02.242 --> 57:03.272
This isn't good.

57:03.273 --> 57:05.112
(Seowon Arts High School)

57:06.112 --> 57:07.242
Let me carry you.

57:15.483 --> 57:17.923
(Celebratory Audition of Launching Jinsung Phoenix Standard)

57:23.123 --> 57:24.693
(Celebratory Audition of Launching Jinsung Phoenix Standard)

57:45.213 --> 57:49.253
Okay. What a nice performance by Participant Nine.

57:50.353 --> 57:54.322
All right. Last but not least. Participant Ten.

57:54.623 --> 57:57.163
This is the performance of the last participant.

58:09.443 --> 58:10.503
He's handsome.

58:12.072 --> 58:13.872
It looks like it's going to rain anytime now.

58:13.873 --> 58:15.812
Why don't we stop now?

58:15.813 --> 58:17.753
He's the last one.

58:18.612 --> 58:19.682
Let's keep going.

58:23.182 --> 58:24.753
- What?
- What's this?

58:40.233 --> 58:42.902
- Oh, no!
- No!

58:43.242 --> 58:44.612
Call an ambulance right now!

58:44.742 --> 58:46.511
- Oh, no!
- He collapsed!

58:46.512 --> 58:47.813
- He passed out!
- Sir, we should go.

58:51.583 --> 58:53.583
Hey, are you all right?

59:03.623 --> 59:04.663
That's so funny.

59:08.963 --> 59:11.902
What? Gosh. Come on.

59:43.702 --> 59:46.503
(Out of order)

59:59.813 --> 01:00:02.253
A patient coming through. Please step aside.

01:00:03.083 --> 01:00:05.893
- Please step aside.
- We have a patient. Please move.

01:00:06.353 --> 01:00:07.393
Dad.

01:00:08.222 --> 01:00:10.192
Where's the ER?

01:00:10.193 --> 01:00:11.462
What's wrong with her?

01:00:11.463 --> 01:00:13.091
She lost consciousness and collapsed.

01:00:13.092 --> 01:00:14.602
- She needs help now!
- This way.

01:00:14.603 --> 01:00:15.733
What's her name?

01:00:15.932 --> 01:00:17.362
It's Yoon Chung Ah.

01:00:25.012 --> 01:00:26.012
Mom.

01:00:50.402 --> 01:00:53.233
(Special thanks to Park Ho San)

01:01:20.432 --> 01:01:25.273
(Twinkling Watermelon)

01:01:25.372 --> 01:01:26.573
We're friends starting now.

01:01:26.903 --> 01:01:28.702
Yoon Chung Ah.

01:01:28.903 --> 01:01:31.141
He called my name.

01:01:31.142 --> 01:01:33.942
By the way, what happened to your sidekick?

01:01:33.943 --> 01:01:35.011
He left.

01:01:35.012 --> 01:01:36.312
But he has no place to go.

01:01:36.313 --> 01:01:38.051
What about Eun Gyeol? He's not coming?

01:01:38.052 --> 01:01:40.281
Whatever. If you want him, you go and look for him.

01:01:40.282 --> 01:01:42.152
I'm looking for someone. Can you take a look at this?

01:01:42.153 --> 01:01:44.152
Only Ha Eun Gyeol can be the main guitarist of our band.

01:01:44.153 --> 01:01:45.391
I will find him no matter what.

01:01:45.392 --> 01:01:47.891
I must find Ha Eun Gyeol and check it myself.

01:01:47.892 --> 01:01:50.991
Mom. Dad. I want to come home.

01:01:50.992 --> 01:01:52.733
I'm doing very well.

01:01:52.863 --> 01:01:54.503
Don't ever call me again.
